{"id":"xgn55ufzsw6wjyjsxzwhs412k","title":"全球股市：AI 涨势能否持续？","originalTitle":"Global Equity Markets: Can The Stock Market Rally Continue Beyond AI?","summary":"BlackRock 的全球首席投资官 Carrie King 和全球投资与组合解决方案负责人 Alex Brazier 讨论了驱动全球股市的因素，包括企业盈利、AI 投资和技术进步。他们指出，尽管美国股市在过去三年表现强劲，但市场集中度和 AI 涨势的可持续性成为关注焦点，投资者正寻求多元化投资机会。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha"},"links":{"original":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4966913-global-equity-markets-can-stock-market-rally-continue-beyond-ai?source=feed_all_articles"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T13:30:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T13:36:23.566Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T13:36:23.566Z","category":"stock-us","tags":["研究报告"],"score":33,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"e3620784-9b20-41f7-8653-faf51efdaeb6","title":"BlackRock高管警示AI投资可持续性及美股集中度风险"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"e3620784-9b20-41f7-8653-faf51efdaeb6","title":"BlackRock高管警示AI投资可持续性及美股集中度风险"}],"topics":[{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fF8gXcaAruto","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}